Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.25,0:00:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.65,0:00:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.51,0:00:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on the move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.45,0:01:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The KC Grand Championship\Nis heating up after
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.97,0:01:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,some incredible duels and stunning upsets.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.11,0:01:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We're moving into the\Nsemi-finals where Rebecca Hawkins
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.59,0:01:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Balbrey Ginger, Leon Wilson,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.83,0:01:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,and Siegfried Lloyd will\Nduke it out for a title
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.25,0:01:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,shot against the international\NDuel Monsters champion,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.95,0:01:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi Moto! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.79,0:01:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.23,0:01:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,As you requested, we've conducted\Nan in-depth investigation of Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.93,0:01:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Siegfried Lloyd.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.89,0:01:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,This better be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.79,0:01:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears Siegfried\Nhas participated in over
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.31,0:01:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,50 tournaments in the\Nlast three years alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.83,0:01:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,each time ranking in the top five.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.71,0:01:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But our research revealed almost nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.25,0:01:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,about personal background\Nor family history,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.05,0:01:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,and there's no record of any connection\Nwith that Schroeder family you mentioned.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.23,0:01:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,So this Siegfried has been winning\Ntournaments around the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.63,0:01:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,and no one knows anything about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.27,0:02:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.18,0:02:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,he gains entry into these\Ntournaments by receiving
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.27,0:02:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,letters of recommendation\Nfrom local politicians.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.23,0:02:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, like who?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.75,0:02:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I have compiled a list with dozens of\Nnames, but none were available for comment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.63,0:02:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,They just need some incentive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.89,0:02:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me take a look at this list of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.03,0:02:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.94,0:02:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,He has some powerful people in his corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.11,0:02:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Number 13
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.97,0:02:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Question that man again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.15,0:02:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And if he still refuses\Nto make a comment, I want
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.77,0:02:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,you to make him an offer\Nhe can't refuse Yes, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.03,0:02:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.47,0:02:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got you by the tail, you rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.31,0:02:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh man, Joey lost
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.31,0:02:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.05,0:02:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.96,0:02:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That means Yugi can cheer\Nfor me from now on! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.57,0:03:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I was knocked out of the\Ntournament by a guy with pink hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.35,0:03:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, a guy with pink hair\Nwho's an expert duelist.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.67,0:03:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to be number one!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.03,0:03:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, you grow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.13,0:03:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, there'll be other duels.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.15,0:03:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not the one who's\Na runner-up every year.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.05,0:03:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That honor belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.01,0:03:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.31,0:03:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Think of it this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.85,0:03:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end, every match you lose\Njust helps make you a better duelist.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.81,0:03:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he should be the best by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.03,0:03:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.63,0:03:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, it's your grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.23,0:03:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.43,0:03:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.69,0:03:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, did he ever make it to the medical\Ncenter after he threw his back out?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.83,0:03:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,He was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.25,0:03:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oi, my back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.13,0:03:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.07,0:03:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get the doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.98,0:03:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,In the meanwhile, try not to\Nmove. Dr. Grossfeld? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.83,0:04:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.69,0:04:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca's duel! Now! Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.53,0:04:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't missed it! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.47,0:04:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.55,0:04:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Now finish him off!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.33,0:04:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a true Hawkins!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.15,0:04:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yes, the doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.55,0:04:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's have a look here, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.53,0:04:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like your friend's been cured.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.53,0:04:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll send you a bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.95,0:04:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wish I hadn't been distracted.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.03,0:04:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't sweat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.07,0:04:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Gramps is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.41,0:04:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But he was barely able to move a muscle,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.69,0:04:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,so he couldn't possibly\Nhave gotten out of that bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.25,0:04:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe someone came and helped him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.03,0:04:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but who?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.69,0:04:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps his secret admirer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.65,0:04:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you be serious for once?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.65,0:04:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What, you saying Gramps is unattractive?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.89,0:04:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we need a plan, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.81,0:04:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He may be in real trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.73,0:04:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You got a point there, Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.13,0:04:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He does have the worst\Nluck of anyone I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.03,0:05:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just think positive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.53,0:05:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he's just\Nfine, pal. Me too. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.75,0:05:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And his girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.75,0:05:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right. Thanks, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.65,0:05:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, no sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.55,0:05:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Professor Hawkins, you should\Ngo and cheer for Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.93,0:05:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we'll catch up later.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.53,0:05:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as soon as we find Yugi's grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.79,0:05:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Best of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.07,0:05:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.79,0:05:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell Rebecca we're all rooting\Nfor her and we'll see her soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.95,0:05:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.87,0:05:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, let's split up and\Nfind that grandpa. Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.67,0:05:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.45,0:05:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.11,0:05:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought they'd be here\Nto cheer me on. Rebecca!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.97,0:05:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.39,0:05:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.81,0:05:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done, Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.45,0:05:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're in the semi-finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.41,0:05:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, but I thought Yugi would be\Nhere to watch me. Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.61,0:05:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he had to deal with a situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.65,0:06:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm sure he'll come\Nback just as soon as he can.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.91,0:06:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, you have a duel to focus on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.55,0:06:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.71,0:06:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll all be here before\Nthe match is through.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.45,0:06:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.87,0:06:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and Yugi told me to tell\Nyou that he's rooting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.85,0:06:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, he did?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.95,0:06:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, those were his exact words? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.93,0:06:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's go before we're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.23,0:06:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This is awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.01,0:06:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,For the first time in my life, I'm tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.17,0:06:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.85,0:06:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just like our town,\Nonly everything's mini.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.57,0:06:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Except him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.01,0:06:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The detail on these statues is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.13,0:06:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I must have dozed off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.09,0:06:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And they speak, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.87,0:06:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Leon Wilson.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.19,0:06:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I was up all night practicing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.43,0:06:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose I just needed a nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.53,0:06:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.59,0:06:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So when's Yugi gonna show up?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.53,0:06:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I was really hoping he\Ncould watch my next duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.25,0:07:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be here, but he's\Ngonna be rooting for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.33,0:07:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And what about your\Nfriends and family, Leon?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.15,0:07:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't they be here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.01,0:07:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, everyone was too busy to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.13,0:07:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm used to being on my own. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.77,0:07:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.68,0:07:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, not this time. Huh? Take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.55,0:07:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you see what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.59,0:07:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You two are surrounded by\Nfans who came to cheer you on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.15,0:07:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now don't let them down!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.49,0:07:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.25,0:07:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's make this the best\Nduel they've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.71,0:07:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.75,0:07:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But I still wish my Yugi was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.49,0:07:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.40,0:07:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Moro, you out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.13,0:07:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello? Grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.55,0:08:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention, Kybaland\Nguests. A short, stocky,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.77,0:08:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,elderly gentleman in overalls and a black
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.07,0:08:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,headband has been separated\Nfrom his loved ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.09,0:08:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,If anyone has lost a grandpa, he's\Nwaiting for you at the main gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.11,0:08:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Overalls in a headband?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.59,0:08:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.95,0:08:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.03,0:08:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that announcement?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.43,0:08:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and I guess you guys did too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.01,0:08:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.92,0:08:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And how many elderly gentlemen\Nwith overalls do you guys know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.71,0:08:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,One.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.62,0:08:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The only problem is he's\Nnot here. Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.17,0:08:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You think we're at the wrong gate?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.71,0:08:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, check that out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.61,0:08:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Grandpa put it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.81,0:08:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.72,0:08:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's some kind of map.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.35,0:08:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like the whole\Nlayout of Kaiba Land.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.21,0:08:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And look!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.89,0:08:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,X marks the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.13,0:09:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So you mean if we find that\Nspot, we'll find Grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.07,0:09:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.91,0:09:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like the looks of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.35,0:09:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would Yugi's grandfather pay\Njust to come here, run and hide,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.03,0:09:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,and then leave us a map\Nso we can find him, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.69,0:09:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.19,0:09:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That someone set a trap for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.93,0:09:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm not going to fall for any trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.37,0:09:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,If we want to save\NGrandpa, we might have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.11,0:09:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, it's time to\Nbegin our semi-final round.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.79,0:09:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Our first duel picks, Sidfrey\NLloyd against Balfrey Ginger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.35,0:09:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,These two daffodans will face off\Nin Kyber Corp's Galaxy Theater.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.23,0:09:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And now on to our second matchup,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.15,0:09:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,featuring the two youngest minors\Nto ever join a major tournament,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.73,0:09:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca Hawkins and Leon Wilson.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.41,0:09:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,These small fries will wage\Nwar in small town, USA!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.51,0:10:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, duelists, begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.83,0:10:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.73,0:10:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.91,0:10:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca's got nothing on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.37,0:10:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Scratch this wannabe!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.17,0:10:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kick things off, if you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.63,0:10:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,So, the first thing I'll do is\Nactivate my graceful charity!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.65,0:10:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can draw three new cards, and\Nthen I discard two from my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.57,0:10:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll send these two to the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.15,0:10:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And since one of them happens\Nto be Marie the Fallen One,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.49,0:10:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I gain an extra 200 life\Npoints with every turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.27,0:10:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not done yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.89,0:10:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Next I play Fire Princess in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.75,0:10:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll place one card\Nface down and end my
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.83,0:10:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn. I'll start things off\Nby summoning Forest Wolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.35,0:11:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Now attack Rebecca's Fire Princess\Nwith Fairy Tail Fang Attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.55,0:11:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What big teeth he has, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.59,0:11:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, as the fairy tale goes, the better\Nto devour your princess with, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.63,0:11:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,So, is that the big bad wolf?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.27,0:11:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong story.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.61,0:11:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I play a magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.39,0:11:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So go, Curse of Thorns!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.43,0:11:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,This stops Marie the Fallen One\Nfrom using her special ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.81,0:11:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad, kid. Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.49,0:11:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad you liked it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.21,0:11:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, my move.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.83,0:11:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon my bluster dragon in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.27,0:11:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Leon,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.77,0:12:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,if you think your forest wolf has a big\Nmouth, then take a close look at my dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.79,0:12:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The better to blast you\Nback to Fairyland with.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.89,0:12:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,When my forest wolf is destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.57,0:12:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,whatever monsters he\Nswallowed return to the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.69,0:12:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So you got your princess back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.81,0:12:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice dueling. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.97,0:12:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's more where that came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.31,0:12:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Like this direct attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.91,0:12:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That should do for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.11,0:12:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you're just as good\Nas they say you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.03,0:12:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you think that\Nscares me, you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.91,0:12:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.59,0:12:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll start by playing Glyph the\NPhantom Bird in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.01,0:12:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Big deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.25,0:12:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as I activate\Nmy face down magic card,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.11,0:12:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,his oversized chicken will be useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.41,0:13:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,In case you hadn't noticed, when my\NPhantom Bird is summoned to the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.41,0:13:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,he destroys one of my\Nopponent's trap or magic cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.01,0:13:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, Glyph the Phantom\NBird, attack her princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.59,0:13:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll activate a magic\Ncard known as Gingerbread House.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.61,0:13:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you think my fairy tale is good\Nnow, just wait till the happy ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.87,0:13:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.29,0:13:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see what you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.69,0:13:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mind if I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.31,0:13:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll start by...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.67,0:13:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.57,0:13:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.27,0:13:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,How strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.79,0:13:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,He just raised the attack\Npoints of Rebecca's monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.43,0:14:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just like my mom says,\Ndon't fill up on sweets.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.43,0:14:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I know my gingerbread house\Nseems like a good thing at first,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.01,0:14:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,but once you go inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.67,0:14:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,there's a price to be paid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.39,0:14:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, you get 600 points, but if your\Nmonster's total is 2,500 or more, boom!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.31,0:14:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's destroyed, and then I'm\Nrewarded with 500 extra life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.37,0:14:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Leon's cards are so weird, and\NI've never seen any of them before!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.27,0:14:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough, gang!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.71,0:14:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I activate the shallow grave!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.73,0:14:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.65,0:14:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So we each choose one\Nmonster to transfer from our
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.81,0:14:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,graveyard are back to the\Nfield in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.71,0:14:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So how about a warm welcome\Nfor my luster dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.13,0:14:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And let's give it up for the\Nreturn of my forest wolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.31,0:14:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll sacrifice my luster dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.97,0:14:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That lets me summon luster\Ndragon number two in its place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.77,0:15:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, LD.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.27,0:15:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to show that overgrown\Npigeon of his what you've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.03,0:15:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Emerald flame attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.51,0:15:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Had enough yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.27,0:15:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I gotta admit, you're\Npretty good, Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.15,0:15:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But this story is not over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.65,0:15:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,So sit back and enjoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.77,0:15:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I'll switch my\Nwolf into attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.35,0:15:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll summon a girl you might\Nremember from your old bedtime stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.93,0:15:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And thanks to her fairy godmother,\Nshe'll be able to go to the ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.77,0:15:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You guessed it! It's Cinderella!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.55,0:15:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And her special ability lets me automatically\Nsummon pumpkin carrots to the field!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.73,0:15:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And what princess is complete\Nwithout her glass slippers?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.77,0:15:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.68,0:15:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a break!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.03,0:15:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.27,0:16:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as that pumpkin\Ncarriage is on the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.01,0:16:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Cinderella is able to bypass your dragon\Nand attack you directly. Now, Cinderella,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.87,0:16:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,kick off those slippers and let's party
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.77,0:16:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But Cinderella never takes away\Nsomeone's life points without giving
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.77,0:16:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Something back in return. A perfect\Nfit. My dragon's wearing slippers?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.25,0:16:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.19,0:16:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,and as long as your dragon sports that\Nstylish footwear, it can attack Cinderella.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.27,0:16:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and did I mention your\Ndragon loses 1,000 attack points?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.03,0:16:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that all?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.67,0:16:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.58,0:16:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't forget about my\Nwolf in grandma's clothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.39,0:16:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.23,0:16:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And of course, whenever a monster\Nwearing glass slippers is destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.37,0:17:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Cinderella receives a brand new pair\Nthat she can use for her next attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.71,0:17:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And the second pair gives\Nher a 1,000-point boost.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.91,0:17:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and last but not\Nleast, one face-down card.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.19,0:17:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to fight against\NLeon's deck of fairy tale rejects?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.57,0:17:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They're driving me nuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.23,0:17:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And I gave up these lame stories\Nwhen I threw out my teddy bear!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.21,0:17:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Here goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.69,0:17:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,My move!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.91,0:17:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And I think it's about time one of\Nus played a real card for a chain!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.11,0:17:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Tribute to the Doom!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.77,0:17:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So, who's afraid of the big bad wolf?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.81,0:17:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Not me, thanks to this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.47,0:17:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll activate the magic\Ncard, Stamping Destruction!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.13,0:17:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It destroys one magic\Ncard on the field and
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.05,0:17:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,delivers 500 points of\Ndamage to that card's owner!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.97,0:17:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And finally, I'll give your\Nprincess a royal butt-kicking!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.69,0:18:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, not if I can help it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.57,0:18:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate my Mirror Force Trap Card.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.61,0:18:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So your attack is deflected\Nand bounced right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.19,0:18:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.41,0:18:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.41,0:18:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem upset. Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.49,0:18:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Dueling is supposed to be fun, Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.15,0:18:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at Cinderella.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.09,0:18:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,She's having a ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.35,0:18:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I'm fighting against\Nprincesses and fairies. And losing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.83,0:18:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,A victory just wasn't in the\Nstars for you. Here's your winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.79,0:18:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The dreading and tasteful\NSiegfried Lloyd Come and get me,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.17,0:18:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Herr Kyloch
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.93,0:18:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on to you, Siegfried.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.17,0:19:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you guys sure we're\Ngoing the right way?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.43,0:19:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Assuming we can trust that map, Yugi's\Ngrandpa should be right around that corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.55,0:19:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just hope he's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.71,0:19:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,He better be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.21,0:19:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it. He's in a Chinese restaurant?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.11,0:19:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean while we were running around like\Nlunatics, Grandpa was eating wonton soup?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.29,0:19:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Yugi, be careful
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.01,0:19:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.92,0:19:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You in there? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.83,0:19:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what it takes, I'll save you.
